{
    "openapi": "3.0.3",
    "info": {
        "title": "Propetware API",
        "version": "1.0.0",
        "description": "## Rate limiting\n\nEvery endpoint under `/v1` is rate limited to **600 requests per minute**. The window is\nanchored to the first request that consumes quota rather than to the clock: it opens on\nthat request, lasts sixty seconds, and then the whole allowance is restored at once. A\nclient that spends its budget in five seconds waits out the remaining fifty-five, not\nuntil the next minute boundary. `X-RateLimit-Reset` gives the exact moment the\nallowance returns.\n\nThe limit is counted **per API client**, not per IP address and not per account. Two\nintegrations holding separate API keys therefore get 600 requests each and cannot\nstarve one another, while a single integration cannot buy extra capacity by calling\nfrom more than one host or by spreading its calls across several accounts. Requests\nauthenticated with a JWT are counted per user instead; `POST /auth/login`, the one\nendpoint reachable without a key, is counted per source IP.\n\nA request carrying an invalid or missing API key is rejected with `401` before the\nlimiter runs, so authentication failures never consume a client's quota.\n\nThe 600/minute figure is the deployed default. It is a server-side setting rather than\npart of this contract, so treat it as the value to design against rather than a\nconstant to hard-code, and read the real ceiling from `X-RateLimit-Limit` at runtime.\n\n### Headers\n\nEvery response to an authenticated request carries the client's current budget,\nwhatever its status code:\n\n| Header | Sent on | Meaning |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `X-RateLimit-Limit` | every counted response | Maximum requests permitted in the window. |\n| `X-RateLimit-Remaining` | every counted response | Requests still available in this window. |\n| `X-RateLimit-Reset` | `429` only | Unix timestamp (seconds) when the allowance returns. |\n| `Retry-After` | `429` only | Seconds to wait before retrying. |\n\n\"Counted\" excludes the `401` returned for a bad or missing API key, which is produced\nbefore the limiter and therefore carries no rate-limit headers.\n\nBecause `X-RateLimit-Remaining` is present on ordinary `200` responses, a client can\nslow itself down *before* being throttled instead of discovering the ceiling by hitting\nit. Watching that header is the cheapest flow control available - and it is the only\none that keeps working if the deployed limit changes.\n\n### When the limit is exceeded\n\nRequests over the limit are rejected with `429 Too Many Requests` and are **not\nprocessed at all** - nothing is created, updated or deleted - so retrying a `429` is\nalways safe, including for `POST`, `PATCH` and `DELETE`.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"message\": \"Too Many Attempts.\"\n}\n```\n\n### Recommended client behaviour\n\n1. **Start from `Retry-After`, not from a guess.** Sleep for the number of seconds the\n   response gives you before the first retry. A fixed one-second retry against a\n   one-minute window simply spends the next sixty seconds collecting more `429`s.\n2. **Back off exponentially.** If a retry is throttled again, double the delay:\n   `Retry-After`, then `2 x`, `4 x`, `8 x`, capped at a ceiling you choose (five\n   minutes is a reasonable one).\n3. **Add jitter.** Multiply each delay by a random factor in the range `0.5`-`1.5`.\n   Without it, every worker that was throttled at the same moment retries at the same\n   moment, and the burst that caused the problem is reproduced exactly.\n4. **Give up eventually, and keep the work.** Cap the number of attempts and queue the\n   request for later rather than discarding it - a `429` says \"not now\", never \"no\".\n5. **Do not parallelise around the limit.** The bucket is per API client, so adding\n   workers or hosts raises the rate at which the shared budget is spent without raising\n   the budget. Spread work over time instead.\n\nA minimal implementation:\n\n```\ndelay = max(1, response.headers[\"Retry-After\"])\nfor attempt in 1..6:\n    sleep(delay * random_between(0.5, 1.5))\n    response = send(request)\n    if response.status != 429:\n        return response\n    delay = min(delay * 2, 300)\nenqueue_for_later(request)\n```\n\n### If 600/minute is not enough\n\nBefore asking for a higher ceiling, check whether the traffic is necessary. Sustained\nthrottling almost always comes from one of three habits:\n\n- **Polling a collection on a short timer.** Subscribe to the relevant webhook events\n  instead and react to changes as they happen. One webhook delivery replaces however\n  many polls it took to notice the change.\n- **Re-fetching each item of a list that was just returned in full.** Collection\n  endpoints return the same representation as the corresponding single-resource\n  endpoint, so the follow-up `GET` per row is usually redundant.\n- **Paging in very small pages.** Raise `perPage` rather than making more requests. It\n  defaults to 25 and accepts up to 200, so a 200-row sweep is one request at the\n  maximum and eight at the default.\n\nIf the volume is genuinely required after that, contact support with the integration's\nAPI key and its expected peak rate.\n"
    },
    "servers": [
        {
            "url": "https://api.propetware.com/v1",
            "description": "Production environment"
        }
    ],
    "paths": {
        "/auth/login": {
            "post": {
                "summary": "Login customer",
                "tags": [
                    "Authentication"
                ],
                "description": "Authenticate a customer and receive JWT token\n**Currently unavailable.** This endpoint returns `401 Unauthorized` for every request regardless of input \u2014 the JWT customer-authentication surface is disabled server-side. Use API key authentication instead. This description will be updated when the surface is enabled.\n",
                "operationId": "loginCustomer",
                "requestBody": {
                    "required": true,
                    "content": {
                        "application/json": {
                            "schema": {
                                "type": "object",
                                "required": [
                                    "email",
                                    "password"
                                ],
                                "properties": {
                                    "email": {
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "format": "email"
                                    },
                                    "password": {
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "format": "password"
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "Login successful",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "type": "object",
                                    "properties": {
                                        "token": {
                                            "type": "string",
                                            "description": "JWT access token"
                                        },
                                        "expiresIn": {
                                            "type": "integer",
                                            "description": "Token expiration time in seconds"
                                        }
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
                    },
                    "429": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "/auth/refresh": {
            "post": {
                "summary": "Refresh JWT token",
                "tags": [
                    "Authentication"
                ],
                "description": "Refresh an existing JWT token\n**Currently unavailable.** This endpoint returns `401 Unauthorized` for every request regardless of input \u2014 the JWT customer-authentication surface is disabled server-side. Use API key authentication instead. This description will be updated when the surface is enabled.\n",
                "operationId": "refreshToken",
                "security": [
                    {
                        "BearerAuth": []
                    }
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "Token refreshed successfully",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "type": "object",
                                    "properties": {
                                        "token": {
                                            "type": "string"
                                        },
                                        "expiresIn": {
                                            "type": "integer"
                                        }
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
                    },
                    "429": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "/auth/logout": {
            "post": {
                "summary": "Logout customer",
                "tags": [
                    "Authentication"
                ],
                "description": "Invalidate the current JWT token\n**Currently unavailable.** This endpoint returns `401 Unauthorized` for every request regardless of input \u2014 the JWT customer-authentication surface is disabled server-side. Use API key authentication instead. This description will be updated when the surface is enabled.\n",
                "operationId": "logoutCustomer",
                "security": [
                    {
                        "BearerAuth": []
                    }
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "Logout successful",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "type": "object",
                                    "properties": {
                                        "message": {
                                            "type": "string",
                                            "example": "Successfully logged out"
                                        }
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
                    },
                    "429": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "/auth/me": {
            "get": {
                "summary": "Get current customer",
                "tags": [
                    "Authentication"
                ],
                "description": "Get the currently authenticated customer's information\n**Currently unavailable.** This endpoint returns `401 Unauthorized` for every request regardless of input \u2014 the JWT customer-authentication surface is disabled server-side. Use API key authentication instead. This description will be updated when the surface is enabled.\n",
                "operationId": "getCurrentCustomer",
                "security": [
                    {
                        "BearerAuth": []
                    }
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "Current customer information",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Customer"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
                    },
                    "429": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "/accounts": {
            "get": {
                "summary": "List accounts",
                "tags": [
                    "Accounts"
                ],
                "description": "Retrieve a list of accounts the current credentials have access to. It will return more than one account for multi-location API keys.",
                "operationId": "listAccounts",
                "security": [
                    {
                        "ApiKeyAuth": []
                    }
                ],
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "name": "q",
                        "in": "query",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "maxLength": 200
                        },
                        "description": "Search by name or email"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "status",
                        "in": "query",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "enum": [
                                "active",
                                "inactive"
                            ]
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "sort",
                        "in": "query",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "enum": [
                                "id",
                                "businessName",
                                "createdAt"
                            ]
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "order",
                        "in": "query",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "enum": [
                                "asc",
                                "desc"
                            ]
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "perPage",
                        "in": "query",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "minimum": 1,
                            "maximum": 200,
                            "default": 25
                        },
                        "description": "Number of items per page"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "page",
                        "in": "query",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "minimum": 1,
                            "default": 1
                        },
                        "description": "Page number for pagination"
                    }
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "Accounts list",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PaginatedAccounts"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
                    },
                    "429": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "/accounts/{accountId}": {
            "get": {
                "summary": "Get account details",
                "tags": [
                    "Accounts"
                ],
                "description": "Retrieve details of a specific account",
                "operationId": "getAccount",
                "security": [
                    {
                        "ApiKeyAuth": []
                    }
                ],
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "name": "accountId",
                        "in": "path",
                        "required": true,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "integer"
                        },
                        "description": "The account ID"
                    }
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "Account details",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Account"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
                    },
                    "403": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden"
                    },
                    "404": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound"
                    },
                    "429": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "/accounts/{accountId}/users": {
            "get": {
                "summary": "List staff users",
                "tags": [
                    "Users"
                ],
                "description": "Retrieve the staff users for an account. Use this to resolve the `userId` returned against order bookings, and to label records elsewhere in the API that identify the staff member who acted.\n\n**Deactivated staff are included by default.** ProPet deactivates a staff member rather than erasing them, and historical records keep referencing their `userId`, so those records must stay resolvable. Deactivated staff are returned with `active: false` and a `deletedAt` timestamp. Pass `active=true` for current staff only.\n",
                "operationId": "listUsers",
                "security": [
                    {
                        "ApiKeyAuth": []
                    }
                ],
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "name": "accountId",
                        "in": "path",
                        "required": true,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "integer"
                        },
                        "description": "The account ID"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "q",
                        "in": "query",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "maxLength": 200
                        },
                        "description": "Partial match on the staff member's name"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "active",
                        "in": "query",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "enum": [
                                "true",
                                "false",
                                "1",
                                "0"
                            ]
                        },
                        "description": "Omit to return all staff. `true` returns only current staff, `false` returns only deactivated staff. Any value outside the four listed returns `422` - the comparison is case sensitive.\n\nDeclared as a string enum rather than `type: boolean` deliberately: a query string carries `true`/`false` as text, and Laravel's boolean validation rejects those literals.\n"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "perPage",
                        "in": "query",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "minimum": 1,
                            "maximum": 200,
                            "default": 25
                        },
                        "description": "Number of items per page"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "page",
                        "in": "query",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "minimum": 1,
                            "default": 1
                        },
                        "description": "Page number for pagination"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "sort",
                        "in": "query",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "enum": [
                                "id",
                                "name",
                                "createdAt",
                                "updatedAt"
                            ],
                            "default": "name"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "order",
                        "in": "query",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "enum": [
                                "asc",
                                "desc"
                            ],
                            "default": "asc"
                        }
                    }
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "Staff users list",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PaginatedUsers"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
                    },
                    "403": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden"
                    },
                    "404": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound"
                    },
                    "429": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "/accounts/{accountId}/users/{userId}": {
            "get": {
                "summary": "Get staff user",
                "tags": [
                    "Users"
                ],
                "description": "Retrieve a single staff user by ID. Deactivated staff resolve as well, so a `userId` taken from an older booking or payment always resolves to a name.\n",
                "operationId": "getUser",
                "security": [
                    {
                        "ApiKeyAuth": []
                    }
                ],
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "name": "accountId",
                        "in": "path",
                        "required": true,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "integer"
                        },
                        "description": "The account ID"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "userId",
                        "in": "path",
                        "required": true,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "integer"
                        },
                        "description": "The staff user ID"
                    }
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "Staff user details",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/User"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
                    },
                    "403": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden"
                    },
                    "404": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound"
                    },
                    "429": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "/accounts/{accountId}/customers": {
            "get": {
                "summary": "List customers",
                "tags": [
                    "Customers"
                ],
                "description": "Retrieve a list of customers for an account",
                "operationId": "listCustomers",
                "security": [
                    {
                        "ApiKeyAuth": []
                    }
                ],
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "name": "accountId",
                        "in": "path",
                        "required": true,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "integer"
                        },
                        "description": "The account ID"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "q",
                        "in": "query",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "maxLength": 200
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "email",
                        "in": "query",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "maxLength": 255
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "perPage",
                        "in": "query",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "minimum": 1,
                            "maximum": 200,
                            "default": 25
                        },
                        "description": "Number of items per page"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "page",
                        "in": "query",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "minimum": 1,
                            "default": 1
                        },
                        "description": "Page number for pagination"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "sort",
                        "in": "query",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "enum": [
                                "id",
                                "firstName",
                                "lastName",
                                "email",
                                "createdAt",
                                "updatedAt"
                            ]
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "order",
                        "in": "query",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "enum": [
                                "asc",
                                "desc"
                            ]
                        }
