        "/accounts/{accountId}/orders": {
            "get": {
                "summary": "List orders",
                "tags": [
                    "Orders"
                ],
                "description": "Retrieve a list of orders for an account.\n\n**One day's reservations in a single request.** The four date filters AND together, so an order covering a date `D` - including multi-night boarding that started earlier and has not ended - is:\n\n`GET /accounts/{accountId}/orders?maxStartDate=D&minEndDate=D`\n\nThis composition has always worked and was previously undocumented, which is worth saying plainly: it is not new. `minStartDate=D&maxStartDate=D` is the mistake to avoid - it returns only orders that *began* on `D` and omits every pet already staying. See `maxStartDate` for the full set of compositions.\n\n**An order here does not carry its bookings, pets, kennels or line items.** Those are assembled only by `GET /accounts/{accountId}/orders/{orderId}`, so building a day sheet from this endpoint costs one further request per order - 41 requests for a 40-order day.\n\n**Do not do that.** `GET /accounts/{accountId}/bookings?date=D` answers the same question in one request, one row per pet, with kennels and times resolved and the booking form answers available in the same call. Use this endpoint when you want reservations, and that one when you want the pets.\n\nTo find a single reservation by the number your staff read off a booking sheet, use `orderNumber`.\n\nOrders that are not bookable reservations - change requests, the orders they replaced, declined requests and vouchers - are held back unless you ask for them. See `includeNonBookable`.\n",
                "operationId": "listOrders",
                "security": [
                    {
                        "ApiKeyAuth": []
                    }
                ],
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "name": "accountId",
                        "in": "path",
                        "required": true,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "integer"
                        },
                        "description": "The account ID"
                    },
                    {
                        "$ref": "#/components/parameters/OrderMinStartDate"
                    },
                    {
                        "$ref": "#/components/parameters/OrderMaxStartDate"
                    },
                    {
                        "$ref": "#/components/parameters/OrderMinEndDate"
                    },
                    {
                        "$ref": "#/components/parameters/OrderMaxEndDate"
                    },
                    {
                        "$ref": "#/components/parameters/OrderNumberFilter"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "status",
                        "in": "query",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "enum": [
                                "request",
                                "pending",
                                "booked",
                                "change_request",
                                "replaced",
                                "declined"
                            ]
                        },
                        "description": "Asking for `change_request`, `replaced` or `declined` returns those orders even without `includeNonBookable`.\n"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "type",
                        "in": "query",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "enum": [
                                "boarding",
                                "classes",
                                "daycare",
                                "grooming",
                                "retail",
                                "standalone",
                                "training",
                                "voucher"
                            ]
                        },
                        "description": "Asking for `voucher` returns vouchers even without `includeNonBookable`.\n"
                    },
                    {
                        "$ref": "#/components/parameters/IncludeNonBookable"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "customerId",
                        "in": "query",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "integer"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "petId",
                        "in": "query",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "integer"
                        },
                        "description": "Orders that have at least one booking for this pet.\n\nMatched through the `bookings` table, not on the order itself - an order belongs to a customer and its pets are named by its bookings. A multi-pet reservation is therefore returned in full when any one of its pets matches; it is not narrowed to that pet's bookings. For one row per pet, use `petId` on `GET /accounts/{accountId}/bookings` instead.\n"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "sort",
                        "in": "query",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "enum": [
                                "id",
                                "customerId",
                                "startDate",
                                "endDate",
                                "created",
                                "updated"
                            ],
                            "default": "startDate"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "order",
                        "in": "query",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "enum": [
                                "asc",
                                "desc"
                            ],
                            "default": "desc"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "perPage",
                        "in": "query",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "minimum": 1,
                            "maximum": 200,
                            "default": 25
                        },
                        "description": "Number of items per page"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "page",
                        "in": "query",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "minimum": 1,
                            "default": 1
                        },
                        "description": "Page number for pagination"
                    }
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "Orders list",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PaginatedOrders"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
                    },
                    "403": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden"
                    },
                    "404": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound"
                    },
                    "429": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "/accounts/{accountId}/customers/{customerId}/orders": {
            "get": {
                "summary": "List orders by customer",
                "tags": [
                    "Orders"
                ],
                "description": "Retrieve a list of orders for a specific customer.\n\nIdentical to `GET /accounts/{accountId}/orders` with `customerId` set, including the date-filter composition described there - so this customer's reservations covering a date `D` are `?maxStartDate=D&minEndDate=D`.\n\nLike that endpoint, an order returned here does not carry its bookings, pets or kennels.\n",
                "operationId": "listOrdersByCustomer",
                "security": [
                    {
                        "ApiKeyAuth": []
                    }
                ],
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "name": "accountId",
