    "components": {
        "securitySchemes": {
            "ApiKeyAuth": {
                "type": "apiKey",
                "in": "header",
                "name": "X-API-Key"
            },
            "ApiKeyAuthAlt": {
                "type": "apiKey",
                "in": "header",
                "name": "Authorization",
                "description": "Authorization: ApiKey <key>"
            },
            "BearerAuth": {
                "type": "http",
                "scheme": "bearer",
                "bearerFormat": "JWT"
            }
        },
        "parameters": {
            "IncludeEmptyCustomFields": {
                "name": "includeEmptyCustomFields",
                "in": "query",
                "required": false,
                "schema": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                        "true",
                        "false",
                        "1",
                        "0"
                    ]
                },
                "description": "Opt in to the full `customFields` list.\n\nBy default `customFields` contains only the answers stored on the record, so a field nobody has answered is **absent from the list entirely** and a consumer cannot tell \"unanswered\" from \"not configured\". Pass `true` and every custom field the account has configured for customers/pets is returned - answered or not - each with its `question`, `fieldType` and an `answered` flag, so a full schema can be mapped in one request.\n\nThe default (`false`) response shape is unchanged. Any value outside the four listed returns `422` - the comparison is case sensitive.\n\nDeclared as a string enum rather than `type: boolean` on purpose: query strings carry `true`/`false` as text, and Laravel's boolean validation rejects those literals.\n"
            },
            "OrderMinStartDate": {
                "name": "minStartDate",
                "in": "query",
                "required": false,
                "schema": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "format": "date"
                },
                "description": "Orders whose **start** date is on or after this date.\n\nCombines with the other three date filters using AND - see `maxStartDate` for the composition, and the \"one day's reservations\" recipe you almost certainly want.\n"
            },
            "OrderMaxStartDate": {
                "name": "maxStartDate",
                "in": "query",
                "required": false,
                "schema": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "format": "date"
                },
                "description": "Orders whose **start** date is on or before this date.\n\n**All four date filters AND together, and that is what makes a single day's reservations one request.** An order that covers a date `D` is one that started on or before `D` and ends on or after `D`:\n\n`GET /accounts/{accountId}/orders?maxStartDate=D&minEndDate=D`\n\nThat returns every reservation present on `D`, including multi-night boarding that began earlier and has not ended - which is not what `minStartDate=D&maxStartDate=D` returns. That pair gives only orders that *began* on `D`, and silently omits every pet already staying.\n\nTwo more compositions worth knowing:\n\n* Orders **starting** in a range - arrivals for the week: `minStartDate=Mon&maxStartDate=Sun`\n* Orders **overlapping** a range - everything touching the week: `maxStartDate=Sun&minEndDate=Mon`\n\nDates are compared against the account's own stored dates. Bounds are inclusive on both ends.\n\n**This returns one row per reservation, not per pet.** An order here does not carry its bookings, pets or kennels, so building a day sheet from this endpoint costs one further request per order. If that is what you are after, `GET /accounts/{accountId}/bookings?date=D` returns one row per pet with its kennel in a single request.\n"
            },
            "OrderMinEndDate": {
                "name": "minEndDate",
                "in": "query",
                "required": false,
                "schema": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "format": "date"
                },
                "description": "Orders whose **end** date is on or after this date.\n\nPair with `maxStartDate` for every order covering a single day - see `maxStartDate`.\n"
            },
            "OrderMaxEndDate": {
                "name": "maxEndDate",
                "in": "query",
                "required": false,
                "schema": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "format": "date"
                },
                "description": "Orders whose **end** date is on or before this date.\n\nCombines with the other three using AND - see `maxStartDate`.\n"
            },
            "OrderNumberFilter": {
                "name": "orderNumber",
                "in": "query",
                "required": false,
                "schema": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "maxLength": 32,
                    "pattern": "^#?[A-Za-z]?0*\\d+(\\.\\d+)?$"
                },
                "description": "Find one reservation by the booking number your staff see, exactly as it appears on a booking sheet.\n\nThe number on the resource is composed rather than stored - a `#`, a one-letter service prefix, the number padded to six digits, and an optional `.duplicate` suffix - so this filter decomposes what you send and matches the parts. All of these reach the same order:\n\n`#B001234`, `B001234`, `B1234`, `001234`, `1234`\n\n**A service prefix narrows the type as well as the number.** The same integer is legitimately reused across services, so `#B001234` returns the *boarding* order numbered 1234 and will not return the daycare order that shares that integer. Omit the prefix to match on the number alone.\n\n`#B001234.2` matches only that duplicate; a number without a `.` suffix matches only orders that have no duplicate suffix. The two do not overlap.\n\nPrefixes: `B` boarding, `D` daycare, `F` facility, `V` voucher, `S` standalone, `G` grooming, `T` training, `C` classes, `R` retail, `M` membership.\n\nAnything outside the pattern above is a `422` naming the accepted forms, rather than an empty page that would read as \"no such booking\".\n"
            },
            "IncludeNonBookable": {
                "name": "includeNonBookable",
                "in": "query",
                "required": false,
                "schema": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                        "true",
                        "false",
                        "1",
                        "0"
                    ]
                },
                "description": "Include orders that are not bookable reservations.\n\nFour kinds of order are held back by default, because in each case the reservation the customer actually holds is a **different** order:\n\n* `status: change_request` - a proposed alteration to another order, awaiting the facility's approval. Stored as its own order.\n* `status: replaced` - the order that a change request altered, once the facility approved it. Kept for history.\n* `status: declined` - a request the facility turned down.\n* `type: voucher` - a prepaid credit, not a reservation. Redeemed against real orders later.\n\nPass `true` to have them returned. This is what you need when reacting to an `order.changeRequested` webhook: the event names a `change_request` order, and `GET /accounts/{accountId}/orders/{orderId}` returns `404` for it without this parameter.\n\nOn the list endpoints, naming one of these values in `status` or `type` also returns it, without `includeNonBookable` - a filter for `change_request` cannot mean anything else. The parameter is still the way to get a mixed list.\n\nUse `masterOrderId` on any order returned this way to find the root of its change-request chain.\n\nAny value outside the four listed returns `422` - the comparison is case sensitive. Declared as a string enum rather than `type: boolean` for the reason given on `includeEmptyCustomFields`.\n"
            },
            "IncludeQuestions": {
                "name": "includeQuestions",
                "in": "query",
                "required": false,
                "schema": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                        "true",
                        "false",
                        "1",
                        "0"
                    ]
                },
                "description": "Opt in to the booking form questions and answers on this order.\n\nThese are the questions the facility configured for the service booked - feeding, medication, checkin questions, whatever the account has set up - together with the answers the customer gave when requesting the reservation. They are the same set, in the same order, that facility staff see on the booking sheet.\n\nOmitted entirely unless you pass `true`, because they are the largest thing on an order and resolving them costs a query per service type booked.\n\nAny value outside the four listed returns `422` - the comparison is case sensitive. Declared as a string enum rather than `type: boolean` for the reason given on `includeEmptyCustomFields`.\n"
            },
            "BookingDate": {
                "name": "date",
                "in": "query",
                "required": false,
                "schema": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "format": "date"
                },
                "description": "Every booking present on this date - one day's sheet.\n\n**Overlap, not arrival.** A booking is present on `D` if it started on or before `D` and ends on or after `D`, so a pet three nights into a week's boarding is returned. This is the predicate the facility's own day screens use, and it is the one thing the order list's date filters make easy to get wrong.\n\nMutually exclusive with `minDate`/`maxDate`; sending both is a `422`.\n"
            },
            "BookingMinDate": {
                "name": "minDate",
                "in": "query",
                "required": false,
                "schema": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "format": "date"
                },
                "description": "Start of a date window, inclusive. Requires `maxDate`.\n\nReturns bookings overlapping any part of the window, on the same test as `date`. `minDate=maxDate` is one day and is equivalent to `date`.\n"
            },
            "BookingMaxDate": {
                "name": "maxDate",
                "in": "query",
                "required": false,
                "schema": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "format": "date"
                },
                "description": "End of a date window, inclusive. Requires `minDate`.\n\n**The window may be at most 31 days.** A month, because the two reads this endpoint exists for are a day sheet and a month view; a longer range pages by month, which is twelve requests a year rather than the thousands this endpoint replaces. Anything wider is a `422` rather than a truncated answer.\n"
            },
            "BookingIncludeCancelled": {
                "name": "includeCancelled",
                "in": "query",
                "required": false,
                "schema": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                        "true",
                        "false",
                        "1",
                        "0"
                    ]
                },
                "description": "Include cancelled bookings.\n\nHeld back by default, for the reason the order list holds back replaced orders: a cancelled booking on a day sheet reads as a pet who is coming. Pass `true` to reconcile against what was booked rather than what is happening - the rows come back with `cancelled: true`.\n\nAny value outside the four listed returns `422` - the comparison is case sensitive. Declared as a string enum rather than `type: boolean` for the reason given on `includeEmptyCustomFields`.\n"
            },
            "BookingIncludeQuestions": {
                "name": "includeQuestions",
                "in": "query",
                "required": false,
                "schema": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                        "true",
                        "false",
                        "1",
                        "0"
                    ]
                },
                "description": "Opt in to the booking form questions and answers for this page, returned as a `questions` list **beside** `data` rather than inside each booking.\n\nWith this, a feeding chart for a day is a single request: the bookings say which pet is in which kennel, and `questions` says what to feed them.\n\nThe list is flat and each entry carries `orderId`, `petId` and `serviceType` - join on those three. It is not nested per booking because an add-on service's answers and a retail order's answers have no booking row to hang from, so nesting would silently drop them. The same reasoning applies on the single-order endpoint, where these are a list on the order.\n\nCosts one extra query for the whole page, not one per order.\n\nAny value outside the four listed returns `422` - the comparison is case sensitive. Declared as a string enum rather than `type: boolean` for the reason given on `includeEmptyCustomFields`.\n"
            },
            "KennelActive": {
                "name": "active",
                "in": "query",
                "required": false,
                "schema": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                        "true",
                        "false",
                        "1",
                        "0"
                    ]
                },
                "description": "Filter on whether the kennel, or kennel type, is still in use.\n\nBoth lists include retired rows by default. ProPet removes a kennel by soft deleting it, and historical bookings and split bookings keep referencing that id, so hiding them would leave exactly the unresolvable-id problem these endpoints exist to fix. A retired row comes back with `active: false` and a `deletedAt` timestamp.\n\nPass `true` for only what is currently in use, `false` for only what has been retired, or omit it for both.\n\nAny value outside the four listed returns `422` - the comparison is case sensitive. Declared as a string enum rather than `type: boolean` for the reason given on `includeEmptyCustomFields`.\n"
            },
            "CancellationTypeActive": {
                "name": "active",
                "in": "query",
                "required": false,
                "schema": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                        "true",
                        "false",
                        "1",
                        "0"
                    ]
                },
                "description": "Filter on whether the cancellation reason can still be picked today.\n\nThe list includes retired reasons by default. ProPet removes a reason by soft deleting it, and the orders cancelled under it keep referencing the id, so hiding it would leave exactly the unresolvable-id problem this endpoint exists to fix. A retired reason comes back with `active: false` and a `deletedAt` timestamp.\n\nPass `true` for only the reasons currently offered, `false` for only the retired ones, or omit it for both.\n\nAny value outside the four listed returns `422` - the comparison is case sensitive. Declared as a string enum rather than `type: boolean` for the reason given on `includeEmptyCustomFields`.\n"
            },
            "NoteTagIdFilter": {
                "name": "noteTagId",
                "in": "query",
                "required": false,
                "schema": {
                    "type": "integer"
                },
                "description": "Return only notes carrying this note tag. Resolve tag ids with `/accounts/{accountId}/noteTags`.\n\nMatches a single tag. A note carrying several tags is returned if any of them is this one; there is no way to require a combination.\n\nA retired tag still filters, because notes keep carrying it.\n"
            },
            "NoteTagActive": {
                "name": "active",
                "in": "query",
                "required": false,
                "schema": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                        "true",
                        "false",
                        "1",
                        "0"
                    ]
                },
                "description": "Filter on whether the note tag can still be applied today.\n\nThe list includes retired tags by default. ProPet removes a tag by soft deleting it and the notes carrying it keep the join row, so hiding it would leave a tag on a note that no lookup could name. A retired tag comes back with `active: false` and a `deletedAt` timestamp.\n\nPass `true` for only the tags currently offered, `false` for only the retired ones, or omit it for both.\n\nAny value outside the four listed returns `422` - the comparison is case sensitive. Declared as a string enum rather than `type: boolean` for the reason given on `includeEmptyCustomFields`.\n"
            }
        },
        "schemas": {
            "Account": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                    "id": {
                        "type": "integer",
                        "description": "Account ID"
                    },
                    "franchiseId": {
                        "type": "integer",
                        "nullable": true,
                        "description": "Franchise ID (if part of a franchise)"
                    },
                    "businessName": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "Business name"
                    },
                    "businessEmail": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "nullable": true,
                        "description": "Business email address"
                    },
                    "businessPhone": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "nullable": true,
                        "description": "Business phone number"
                    },
                    "businessWebsite": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "nullable": true,
                        "description": "Business website URL"
                    },
                    "status": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "enum": [
                            "active",
                            "inactive"
                        ],
                        "description": "Account status"
                    },
                    "createdAt": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "format": "date-time",
                        "nullable": true,
                        "description": "Account creation timestamp (ISO 8601)"
                    },
                    "subdomain": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "nullable": true,
                        "description": "Account subdomain"
                    },
                    "currency": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "nullable": true,
                        "description": "Default currency code (e.g., USD, CAD)"
                    },
                    "address": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "nullable": true,
                        "description": "Business address",
                        "properties": {
                            "streetNumber": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "nullable": true,
                                "description": "Street number"
                            },
                            "streetName": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "nullable": true,
                                "description": "Street name"
                            },
                            "city": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "nullable": true,
                                "description": "City"
                            },
                            "province": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "nullable": true,
                                "description": "Province or state"
                            },
                            "region": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "nullable": true,
                                "description": "Region"
                            },
                            "postalCode": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "nullable": true,
                                "description": "Postal or ZIP code"
                            },
                            "country": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "nullable": true,
                                "description": "Country"
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "timezone": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "nullable": true,
                        "description": "Account timezone (e.g., America/New_York)"
                    },
                    "notificationEmails": {
                        "type": "array",
                        "description": "Email addresses for notifications",
                        "items": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "format": "email"
                        }
                    },
                    "forwardingEmails": {
                        "type": "array",
                        "description": "Email addresses for forwarding",
                        "items": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "format": "email"
                        }
                    },
                    "services": {
                        "type": "array",
                        "description": "Services offered by the account",
                        "items": {
                            "type": "string"
                        }
                    }
                },
                "example": {
                    "id": 123,
                    "franchiseId": 5,
                    "businessName": "Pet Hotel & Spa",
                    "businessEmail": "info@pethotel.com",
                    "businessPhone": "555-1234",
                    "businessWebsite": "https://pethotel.com",
                    "status": "active",
                    "createdAt": "2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
                    "subdomain": "pethotel",
                    "currency": "USD",
                    "address": {
                        "streetNumber": "123",
                        "streetName": "Main St",
                        "city": "Springfield",
                        "province": "State",
                        "region": "Region",
                        "postalCode": "12345",
                        "country": "USA"
                    },
                    "timezone": "America/New_York",
                    "notificationEmails": [
                        "notifications@pethotel.com",
                        "manager@pethotel.com"
                    ],
                    "forwardingEmails": [
                        "forward@pethotel.com"
                    ],
                    "services": [
                        "boarding",
                        "daycare",
                        "grooming"
                    ]
                }
            },
            "StandardField": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                    "label": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "Display label for the field"
                    },
                    "included": {
                        "type": "boolean",
                        "description": "Whether the field is included/active on the form"
                    },
                    "required": {
                        "type": "boolean",
                        "description": "Whether the field is required"
                    },
                    "notifyOnChange": {
                        "type": "boolean",
                        "description": "Whether to notify when this field is edited"
                    }
                },
                "example": {
                    "label": "Company Name",
                    "included": true,
                    "required": false,
                    "notifyOnChange": false
                }
            },
            "StandardFieldsMap": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                    "companyName": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/StandardField"
                    },
                    "phoneNumber": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/StandardField"
                    },
                    "streetAddress": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/StandardField"
                    },
                    "suburb": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/StandardField"
                    },
                    "city": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/StandardField"
                    },
                    "province": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/StandardField"
                    },
                    "postalCode": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/StandardField"
                    },
                    "country": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/StandardField"
                    }
                }
            },
            "StandardFieldUpdate": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                    "included": {
                        "type": "boolean"
                    },
                    "required": {
                        "type": "boolean"
                    },
                    "notifyOnChange": {
                        "type": "boolean"
                    }
                }
            },
            "StandardFieldsUpdate": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                    "companyName": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/StandardFieldUpdate"
                    },
                    "phoneNumber": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/StandardFieldUpdate"
                    },
                    "streetAddress": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/StandardFieldUpdate"
                    },
                    "suburb": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/StandardFieldUpdate"
                    },
                    "city": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/StandardFieldUpdate"
                    },
                    "province": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/StandardFieldUpdate"
                    },
                    "postalCode": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/StandardFieldUpdate"
                    },
                    "country": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/StandardFieldUpdate"
                    }
                }
            },
            "CustomFormFieldOption": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                    "label",
                    "value"
                ],
                "properties": {
                    "label": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "Display label for the option"
                    },
                    "value": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "Value stored when this option is selected"
                    }
                },
                "example": {
                    "label": "Email",
                    "value": "email"
                }
            },
            "CustomFormField": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                    "id": {
                        "type": "integer",
                        "description": "Unique identifier for the custom field"
                    },
                    "question": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "The question/label for the field"
                    },
                    "shortQuestion": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "nullable": true,
                        "description": "Shortened version of the question for booking sheets"
                    },
                    "fieldType": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "enum": [
                            "yesno",
                            "text",
                            "textarea",
                            "select",
                            "radio",
                            "checkbox"
                        ],
                        "description": "Type of field input"
                    },
                    "options": {
                        "type": "array",
                        "items": {
                            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CustomFormFieldOption"
                        },
                        "description": "Options for select/radio/checkbox fields"
                    },
                    "showOther": {
                        "type": "boolean",
                        "description": "Whether to include an \"Other\" option"
                    },
                    "isRequired": {
                        "type": "boolean",
                        "description": "Whether the field is required"
                    },
                    "adminOnly": {
                        "type": "boolean",
                        "description": "Whether the field is only visible to admins"
                    },
                    "showOnBookingSheet": {
                        "type": "boolean",
                        "description": "Whether to show the response on booking sheets"
                    },
                    "notifyWhenEdited": {
                        "type": "boolean",
                        "description": "Whether to notify when this field is edited"
                    },
                    "isConditional": {
                        "type": "boolean",
                        "description": "Whether this field is conditionally shown"
                    },
                    "conditionalTrigger": {
                        "type": "integer",
                        "nullable": true,
                        "description": "ID of the yes/no field that triggers this field"
                    },
                    "conditionalResponse": {
                        "type": "integer",
                        "nullable": true,
                        "description": "Response value (0=No, 1=Yes) that triggers this field"
                    },
                    "rememberLastResponse": {
                        "type": "boolean",
                        "description": "Whether to remember the customer's last response"
                    },
                    "trigger": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "nullable": true,
                        "description": "Action to trigger on booking sheet"
                    },
                    "includeOnReport": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "nullable": true,
                        "description": "Report to include this field on"
                    },
                    "itemOrder": {
                        "type": "integer",
                        "description": "Display order of the field"
                    }
                },
                "example": {
                    "id": 123,
                    "question": "Preferred contact method",
                    "shortQuestion": "Contact method",
                    "fieldType": "radio",
                    "options": [
                        {
                            "label": "Email",
                            "value": "email"
                        },
                        {
                            "label": "Phone",
                            "value": "phone"
                        }
                    ],
                    "showOther": false,
                    "isRequired": true,
                    "adminOnly": false,
                    "showOnBookingSheet": true,
                    "notifyWhenEdited": false,
                    "isConditional": false,
                    "conditionalTrigger": null,
                    "conditionalResponse": null,
                    "rememberLastResponse": true,
                    "trigger": null,
                    "includeOnReport": null,
                    "itemOrder": 1
                }
            },
            "CustomFormFieldCreate": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                    "question",
                    "fieldType"
                ],
                "properties": {
                    "question": {
                        "type": "string"
                    },
                    "shortQuestion": {
                        "type": "string"
                    },
                    "fieldType": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "enum": [
                            "yesno",
                            "text",
                            "textarea",
                            "select",
                            "radio",
                            "checkbox"
                        ]
                    },
                    "options": {
                        "type": "array",
                        "items": {
                            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CustomFormFieldOption"
                        }
                    },
                    "showOther": {
                        "type": "boolean"
                    },
                    "isRequired": {
                        "type": "boolean"
                    },
                    "adminOnly": {
                        "type": "boolean"
                    },
                    "showOnBookingSheet": {
                        "type": "boolean"
                    },
                    "notifyWhenEdited": {
                        "type": "boolean"
                    },
                    "isConditional": {
                        "type": "boolean"
                    },
                    "conditionalTrigger": {
                        "type": "integer"
                    },
                    "conditionalResponse": {
                        "type": "integer"
                    },
                    "rememberLastResponse": {
                        "type": "boolean"
                    }
                }
            },
            "CustomFormFieldUpdate": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                    "question": {
                        "type": "string"
                    },
                    "shortQuestion": {
                        "type": "string"
                    },
                    "fieldType": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "enum": [
                            "yesno",
                            "text",
                            "textarea",
                            "select",
                            "radio",
                            "checkbox"
                        ]
                    },
                    "options": {
                        "type": "array",
                        "items": {
                            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CustomFormFieldOption"
                        }
                    },
                    "showOther": {
                        "type": "boolean"
                    },
                    "isRequired": {
                        "type": "boolean"
                    },
                    "adminOnly": {
                        "type": "boolean"
                    },
                    "showOnBookingSheet": {
                        "type": "boolean"
                    },
                    "notifyWhenEdited": {
                        "type": "boolean"
                    },
                    "isConditional": {
                        "type": "boolean"
                    },
                    "conditionalTrigger": {
                        "type": "integer"
                    },
                    "conditionalResponse": {
                        "type": "integer"
                    },
                    "rememberLastResponse": {
                        "type": "boolean"
                    }
                }
            },
            "CustomerFieldsResponse": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                    "standardFields": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/StandardFieldsMap"
                    },
                    "customFields": {
                        "type": "array",
                        "items": {
                            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CustomFormField"
                        }
                    }
                },
                "example": {
                    "standardFields": {
                        "companyName": {
                            "label": "Company Name",
                            "included": true,
                            "required": false,
                            "notifyOnChange": false
                        },
                        "phoneNumber": {
                            "label": "Phone Number",
                            "included": true,
                            "required": true,
                            "notifyOnChange": false
                        }
                    },
                    "customFields": [
                        {
                            "id": 123,
                            "question": "How did you hear about us?",
                            "fieldType": "select",
                            "options": [
                                {
                                    "label": "Google",
                                    "value": "google"
                                },
                                {
                                    "label": "Friend",
                                    "value": "friend"
                                }
                            ],
                            "isRequired": false,
                            "adminOnly": false,
                            "showOnBookingSheet": true,
                            "itemOrder": 1
                        }
                    ]
                }
            },
